  "Software Details": "Softwaredetails",
  "The Duo2FA Integration in eCommerceGo SaaS introduces an additional layer of security, ensuring that both admins and users are protected from unauthorized access. This module leverages the trusted Duo Two-Factor Authentication (2FA) system to provide a robust security solution. By incorporating Duo2FA, eCommerceGo enhances the overall security framework, safeguarding sensitive data and user accounts with minimal effort.": "Die Duo2FA-Integration in eCommerceGo SaaS führt eine zusätzliche Sicherheitsebene ein und stellt sicher, dass sowohl Administratoren als auch Benutzer vor unbefugtem Zugriff geschützt sind. ",
  "Easy Configuration with Required IDs": "Einfache Konfiguration mit erforderlichen IDs",
  "Setting up the Duo2FA module in eCommerceGo SaaS is straightforward. Administrators need to add the required IDs for both the admin and user accounts. This initial configuration is quick and user-friendly, ensuring that businesses can implement enhanced security measures without extensive technical knowledge. The simple setup process allows businesses to promptly benefit from the added security without disrupting their operations.": "Das Einrichten des Duo2FA-Moduls in eCommerceGo SaaS ist unkompliziert. ",
  "Secure Admin and User Logins": "Sichere Administrator- und Benutzeranmeldungen",
  "Once the Duo2FA module is configured, both admins and users will be prompted to enter a unique authentication code upon logging in. This two-step verification process ensures that only authorized individuals can access the platform. By requiring an additional code, which is typically sent to a user’s mobile device, the risk of unauthorized access is significantly reduced. This added layer of security is crucial for protecting sensitive business and customer data.": "Sobald das Duo2FA-Modul konfiguriert ist, werden sowohl Administratoren als auch Benutzer beim Anmelden aufgefordert, einen eindeutigen Authentifizierungscode einzugeben. Dieser zweistufige Überprüfungsprozess stellt sicher, dass nur autorisierte Personen auf die Plattform zugreifen können. ",
  "Enhanced Protection Against Unauthorized Access": "Verbesserter Schutz vor unbefugtem Zugriff",
  "The Duo2FA integration provides enhanced protection against unauthorized access and potential security breaches. With cyber threats becoming increasingly sophisticated, traditional password-based authentication methods are no longer sufficient. Duo2FA ensures that even if a password is compromised, unauthorized users will not be able to access the system without the second authentication factor. This dual-layered security approach is essential for maintaining the integrity of your eCommerce platform.": "Die Duo2FA-Integration bietet verbesserten Schutz vor unbefugtem Zugriff und potenziellen Sicherheitsverletzungen. ",
